  &= \operatorname{Res}\bigl(mB(X),\Phi_{n-1}(X)\bigr)\\
  &= m^{n-1} \operatorname{Res}\bigl(B(X),\Phi_{n-1}(X)\bigr).
\end{align*}
Thus~(ii) is true. 
